The surface field is
\[
g_s=G\frac{M}{R^2}
=\frac{(6.67\times10^{-11})(6.0\times10^{24})}{(6.0\times10^6)^2}
=11.1\,\mathrm{N\,kg^{-1}}
\]
At \(r=3.0\times10^6\,\mathrm{m}=R/2\), inside the uniform sphere,
\[
g=\frac{1}{2}g_s=5.6\,\mathrm{N\,kg^{-1}}
\]
At \(r=1.2\times10^7\,\mathrm{m}=2R\), outside the sphere,
\[
g=\frac{g_s}{4}=2.8\,\mathrm{N\,kg^{-1}}
\]
